# Laid out Medium, the wide frame's tape (sfdesk frame.mbt): MBUI_WIN=690x840 MBUI_FILM_PLATFORM=2, an opened fold's
# inner screen upright (its size classes medium both ways), a finger. The page in use, the sidebar's edge showing at
# its left: tapped there, the sidebar comes over (the row under the tap not opened); a chat tapped in it comes over;
# back brings the sidebar over again; what shows of the chat tapped, it comes back.
system {"size_class":{"width":"medium","height":"medium"}}
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 1000
tapxy 70 420
wait 1300
tap 首页的列表改成按天分组
wait 1500
back
wait 1300
tapxy -80 420
wait 1300
exit
